From e0d8b04997389ee88d0e91b0db38e1735b26f8a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: World of Warcraft <warcraft@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:11:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Custom races: Goblin, Worgen and nine more, for the Android
 app

The World of Warcraft app's custom races (warcraft/races), playable while they are turned on: the
world database and ChrRaces.dbc then have them, and the NPC races they replace sit at 169 to 181.
With the races off, nothing here changes the game.

- Races 9 (Goblin) and 12 to 21 (Worgen, High Elf, Mag'har Orc, Ogre, Dark Iron Dwarf, Zandalari
  Troll, Vulpera, the two Pandaren, Broken), their names, and the display races to match.
- Their first flight paths, the transforms and costumes that pick a model by race, .pinfo's
  names, the Argent Tournament pony's banner, the language a race change gives.
- Druid forms: Tauren and the furred custom races pick theirs by skin colour, the others by hair
  colour (unchanged for the game's own races).
- The Goblin racials (Rocket Barrage's damage, Best Deals Anywhere) and the Worgen's Running Wild.

The race hunks of mod-worgoblin-high-elf's integration/whe-acore.patch and its scripts, at
52fd006 (the rest of that patch, which changes the game for every race, is left out).

Co-authored-by: Medviten <medviten@protonmail.com>
